{
  "schema_version": "1.1",
  "_contract": "parent_count follows local-structural-v1. A body-less heading section (a heading immediately followed by another heading) is merged into the following section by ParentChunkBuilder._merge_heading_only_sections; it never becomes its own parent. This is the behavior fixed by the unit contract test_fusiona_heading_sin_cuerpo_con_siguiente_seccion. Therefore a document with a root '# Title' (no body) plus N sibling '##' sections yields N parents, not N+1. See docs/chunking/decision-log.md 2026-08-06.",
